# Trivy suppressions. Each entry must justify itself.

# DS-0002: "Image user should not be 'root'".
#
# Applies to deploy/kind/node-image/Dockerfile, which extends kindest/node.
# That image *is* a Kubernetes node: it runs kubelet, containerd and runsc, all
# of which require root inside the node container. Adding a USER directive would
# stop the cluster from starting.
#
# The application images this project actually ships (backend, frontend) run as
# UID 1001 and are not covered by this suppression.
DS-0002
